msgid "Durability"
msgstr "Durability"

msgid "Condition"
msgstr "Condition"

msgid "Broken"
msgstr "Broken"

msgid "Tools charge"
msgstr "Tools charge"

msgid "Equipment repair interrupted."
msgstr "Equipment repair interrupted."

msgid "Could not use the tools."
msgstr "Could not use the tools."

msgid "Equipment repaired."
msgstr "Equipment repaired."

msgid "Repair tools spent."
msgstr "Repair tools spent."

msgid "Equipment can only be repaired while conscious and out of combat."
msgstr "Equipment can only be repaired while conscious and out of combat."

msgid "Tools are required to repair equipment."
msgstr "Tools are required to repair equipment."

msgid "Equipment repair is already in progress."
msgstr "Equipment repair is already in progress."

msgid "Repair started. Keep the character still."
msgstr "Repair started. Keep the character still."

msgid "Weapons and armour wear in combat. Tools restore durability."
msgstr "Weapons and armour wear in combat. Tools restore durability."

msgid "Enable plugin"
msgstr "Enable plugin"

msgid "Enables equipment wear, its combat effects, and repairs."
msgstr "Enables equipment wear, its combat effects, and repairs."

msgid "Durability affects smelting"
msgstr "Durability affects smelting"

msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "Diagnostics"

msgid "Detailed log"
msgstr "Detailed log"

msgid "Logs completed repairs and destroyed equipment. Hook errors are always logged."
msgstr "Logs completed repairs and destroyed equipment. Hook errors are always logged."


msgid "NPC equipment wear"
msgstr "NPC equipment wear"

msgid "Applies the same wear, breakage, and destruction rules to NPC equipment."
msgstr "Applies the same wear, breakage, and destruction rules to NPC equipment."

msgid "Destroy items at 0% durability"
msgstr "Destroy items at 0% durability"

msgid "Weapons and armour break at 0% durability. With this option on, they disappear without scrap. With it off, they remain available for repair or smelting. Meitou never breaks."
msgstr "Weapons and armour break at 0% durability. With this option on, they disappear without scrap. With it off, they remain available for repair or smelting. Meitou never breaks."

msgid "Equipment breakage notices"
msgstr "Equipment breakage notices"

msgid "Shows who broke which item in your squads. NPC breakage is always silent."
msgstr "Shows who broke which item in your squads. NPC breakage is always silent."

msgid "#FF6363Weapon on #8BDD70%s#FF6363 broke - %s"
msgstr "#FF6363Weapon on #8BDD70%s#FF6363 broke - %s"

msgid "#FF6363Armour on #8BDD70%s#FF6363 broke - %s"
msgstr "#FF6363Armour on #8BDD70%s#FF6363 broke - %s"

msgid "Repair Weapon"
msgstr "Repair Weapon"

msgid "Repair Armour"
msgstr "Repair Armour"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "Off"

msgid "Top"
msgstr "Top"

msgid "Bottom"
msgstr "Bottom"

msgid "Equipment condition bar"
msgstr "Equipment condition bar"

msgid "Shows a thin durability bar inside icons for worn weapons and armour."
msgstr "Shows a thin durability bar inside icons for worn weapons and armour."

msgid "Wear and breakage"
msgstr "Wear and breakage"

msgid "Weapon damage"
msgstr "Weapon damage"

msgid "Armour protection"
msgstr "Armour protection"

msgid "Durability by tier"
msgstr "Durability by tier"

msgid "Repair"
msgstr "Repair"

msgid "Smelting"
msgstr "Smelting"

msgid "The item furnace scales the material yield according to the condition of the gear."
msgstr "The item furnace scales the material yield according to the condition of the gear."

msgid "Breakage protection from grade"
msgstr "Breakage protection from grade"

msgid "Melee weapons at or above this grade cannot break. 0 protects only vanilla Meitou. Vanilla Meitou is always protected."
msgstr "Melee weapons at or above this grade cannot break. 0 protects only vanilla Meitou. Vanilla Meitou is always protected."

msgid "Melee wear per hit or block"
msgstr "Melee wear per hit or block"

msgid "Durability points lost on a registered hit or block. 0 disables new wear from this action."
msgstr "Durability points lost on a registered hit or block. 0 disables new wear from this action."

msgid "Crossbow wear per shot"
msgstr "Crossbow wear per shot"

msgid "Durability points lost on each shot, including misses. 0 disables new wear from this action."
msgstr "Durability points lost on each shot, including misses. 0 disables new wear from this action."

msgid "Armour wear per hit"
msgstr "Armour wear per hit"

msgid "Durability points lost by the armour layer that covers a hit. 0 disables new wear from this action."
msgstr "Durability points lost by the armour layer that covers a hit. 0 disables new wear from this action."

msgid "Weapon damage starts dropping at (%)"
msgstr "Weapon damage starts dropping at (%)"

msgid "At higher durability the weapon deals full damage. This setting covers melee weapons and crossbows."
msgstr "At higher durability the weapon deals full damage. This setting covers melee weapons and crossbows."

msgid "Weapon damage reaches minimum at (%)"
msgstr "Weapon damage reaches minimum at (%)"

msgid "At or below this durability, weapon damage stays at its minimum until breakage. This value is capped at the start of the penalty."
msgstr "At or below this durability, weapon damage stays at its minimum until breakage. This value is capped at the start of the penalty."

msgid "Minimum weapon damage (%)"
msgstr "Minimum weapon damage (%)"

msgid "Share of the original damage at the bottom of the wear range. Broken weapons stop dealing damage. Protected weapons still use this minimum at 0 durability."
msgstr "Share of the original damage at the bottom of the wear range. Broken weapons stop dealing damage. Protected weapons still use this minimum at 0 durability."

msgid "Armour protection starts dropping at (%)"
msgstr "Armour protection starts dropping at (%)"

msgid "At higher durability, normal armour coverage applies."
msgstr "At higher durability, normal armour coverage applies."

msgid "Armour protection reaches minimum at (%)"
msgstr "Armour protection reaches minimum at (%)"

msgid "At or below this durability, protection stays at its minimum until breakage. This value is capped at the start of the penalty."
msgstr "At or below this durability, protection stays at its minimum until breakage. This value is capped at the start of the penalty."

msgid "Minimum armour effectiveness (%)"
msgstr "Minimum armour effectiveness (%)"

msgid "Chance for a layer to stay effective after passing the normal coverage check, at the bottom of the wear range. At 0 durability a broken layer offers no protection."
msgstr "Chance for a layer to stay effective after passing the normal coverage check, at the bottom of the wear range. At 0 durability a broken layer offers no protection."

msgid "Tier 1 - Rusted / Prototype"
msgstr "Tier 1 - Rusted / Prototype"

msgid "Maximum durability in this tier. Existing wear is stored in points, so changing this value can change the percentage on used gear."
msgstr "Maximum durability in this tier. Existing wear is stored in points, so changing this value can change the percentage on used gear."

msgid "Tier 2 - Mid-Grade / Shoddy"
msgstr "Tier 2 - Mid-Grade / Shoddy"

msgid "Tier 3 - Refitted blades"
msgstr "Tier 3 - Refitted blades"

msgid "Tier 4 - Catun No. 1 / Standard"
msgstr "Tier 4 - Catun No. 1 / Standard"

msgid "Tier 5 - Catun No. 2"
msgstr "Tier 5 - Catun No. 2"

msgid "Tier 6 - Catun No. 3 / High"
msgstr "Tier 6 - Catun No. 3 / High"

msgid "Tier 7 - Mk I to III"
msgstr "Tier 7 - Mk I to III"

msgid "Tier 8 - Edge / Specialist"
msgstr "Tier 8 - Edge / Specialist"

msgid "Tier 9 - Meitou / Masterwork"
msgstr "Tier 9 - Meitou / Masterwork"

msgid "Restored by a full tool kit (%)"
msgstr "Restored by a full tool kit (%)"

msgid "Base share of maximum durability restored with a full charge, before the smithing bonus."
msgstr "Base share of maximum durability restored with a full charge, before the smithing bonus."

msgid "Minimum points per full tool kit"
msgstr "Minimum points per full tool kit"

msgid "The charge restores at least this many points before the smithing bonus. With both repair amounts set to 0, tools restore nothing."
msgstr "The charge restores at least this many points before the smithing bonus. With both repair amounts set to 0, tools restore nothing."

msgid "Repair efficiency bonus at skill 100 (%)"
msgstr "Repair efficiency bonus at skill 100 (%)"

msgid "Extra durability a full charge restores at smithing skill 100. The bonus grows with skill."
msgstr "Extra durability a full charge restores at smithing skill 100. The bonus grows with skill."

msgid "Full tool kit use time, game seconds"
msgstr "Full tool kit use time, game seconds"

msgid "Time to use a full charge at smithing skill 0, at normal game speed. Smaller repairs use less time and charge."
msgstr "Time to use a full charge at smithing skill 0, at normal game speed. Smaller repairs use less time and charge."

msgid "Repair speed bonus at skill 100 (%)"
msgstr "Repair speed bonus at skill 100 (%)"

msgid "Extra repair speed at smithing skill 100. 100 doubles the speed."
msgstr "Extra repair speed at smithing skill 100. 100 doubles the speed."

msgid "Smithing experience from repairs (%)"
msgstr "Smithing experience from repairs (%)"

msgid "100 awards the usual experience per point restored. 0 disables repair experience."
msgstr "100 awards the usual experience per point restored. 0 disables repair experience."

msgid "Smelting yield at 0 durability (%)"
msgstr "Smelting yield at 0 durability (%)"

msgid "Share of the normal materials returned at 0 durability. The yield rises linearly to the normal amount at full durability."
msgstr "Share of the normal materials returned at 0 durability. The yield rises linearly to the normal amount at full durability."
